msgid ""
"We'd be delighted to add more countries, radios and regulations to this "
"table! Please post the information on the forums, giving links to the "
"applicable regulations and information on what it all means. Also, please "
"point out any inaccuracies in the existing table."
msgstr "欢迎向本表添加更多国家、电台和法规信息！请在论坛发布相关信息，提供适用法规链接及其说明。如发现现有表格中有任何不准确之处，也请指出。"

